    "title": "NY Mets 2026 Opening Day roster vs. Pirates, who made the cut?",
    "text": "METSNY Mets announce Opening Day roster for 2026. Who gets the final spots? Andrew TredinnickNorthJersey.comUpdated March 25, 2026, 1:09 p.m. ETNEW YORK — The Mets prioritized another left-handed bat, positional versatility and pitching workload and performance in their final two decisions for their Opening Day roster.The club announced their Opening Day roster Wednesday afternoon ahead of their first matchup with the Pirates on Thursday at Citi Field. Utility man Jared Young and left-handed relief pitcher Richard Lovelady were the final two players to make the cut.",
